      "material_role": "selected_problem",
      "countable_problem_unit": true,
      "root_admission_required": true,
      "source_boundary_note": "Only the full original part(2) of Theorem8.1 is selected, with its common setup and complete part(2) author proof. All new free-Lie quotient/derivation, two-generator bracket, degree-two/three, centralizer, finite-dimensionality and depth-two model support is bundled as uncounted core. The degree-zero derivations preserve both e and f; the unrestricted contact/Cartan conclusion in part(1) is excluded. Named Tanaka/Yamaguchi and first-kind simple-gradation prerequisites remain exact cited background. Original coefficient-domain and depth-qualifier notices are preserved, and the original item number(2) is restored.",
